      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG2_U03_L03_Q13</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U03_L03_Q13</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.RR.1; MLA.A2.RR.3</p><p>Which equation results from squaring sqrt(3x - 2) = x?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[3x - 2 = x&#178;]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Correct. Squaring both sides gives the radicand equal to x squared.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[3x - 2 = x]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The right side must also be squared.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[9x&#178; - 4 = x&#178;]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The radicand itself is not squared after removing the square root.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[3x = x&#178;]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This drops the -2 term.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG2_U03_L03_Q14</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U03_L03_Q14</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.RR.1; MLA.A2.RR.3</p><p>Solve sqrt(x + 12) = x.</p>]]></text>
